// Provenance: profiles below are AI-compiled from model knowledge (cut-off mid-2026) and are stored with
// factType AI_ASSESSMENT and no verification date. They must be confirmed against the company's own site
// before being relied on. Scores (market position, equity upside, compensation competitiveness) are AI
// assessments on a 0-100 scale, never facts. No revenue, valuation, funding or compensation figures are
// seeded: those fields stay empty until a verified source is recorded.
